==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Unified Minds|Lickilicky|162}} from the {{TCG|Unified Minds}} expansion; both cards have the Rollout attack.
*{{m|Rollout}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Lickilicky}} can learn.
